    <outline text="Mashup: Macamuppet or the &quot;The Doors Take A Walk Down Sesame Street&quot; by Pilchard - The Doors, The Manamana Guy, and throw in a little Macarena. via MashupTown &lt;http://mashuptown.com/&gt;"/>
    <outline text="Using Email Addresses in Show Notes">
      <outline text="Kevin Crossman 	&#10;&#10;I didn't like the new show notes format at first but do like seeing the&#10;text of the emails. So, I'm a net positive at this point.&#10;&#10;FYI: It wasn't a big deal for me, a podcaster who has his email address&#10;all over the net, but others might object to you posting their email&#10;addresses in the show notes (where they can be harvested by spam&#10;robots).&#10;&#10;You're spoiling us with all these daily Daily Source Codes. We&#10;appreciate it!&#10;&#10;Kevin Crossman&#10;The Frat Pack Tribute: Saluting Hollywood's Comedy Clique&#10;www.the-frat-pack.com &lt;http://www.the-frat-pack.com/&gt;&#10;Listen to our Podcast at www.fratpackpodcast.com &lt;http://www.fratpackpodcast.com/&gt;&#10;"/>
    </outline>
